Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild plant selector with Dawn style grid and plant modal

Move plant data into plants.js and render the grid, modal and cart from it.
Add hover photo, sort dropdown, filter drawer, shop pills, quantity selector,
collapsible details, lightbox, previous and next plant buttons, image
placeholders, copy cart as text and price checked dates.
